{"id":10165,"mal_id":10165,"title":"Nichijou","englishTitle":"Nichijou - My Ordinary Life","title_english":"Nichijou - My Ordinary Life","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":["Everyday"],"en":"Nichijou - My Ordinary Life","ja":"日常"},"synopsis":"Nichijou primarily focuses on the daily antics of a trio of childhood friends—high school girls Mio Naganohara, Yuuko Aioi and Mai Minakami—whose stories soon intertwine with the young genius Hakase Shinonome, her robot caretaker Nano, and their talking cat Sakamoto. With every passing day, the lives of these six, as well as of the many people around them, experience both the calms of normal life and the insanity of the absurd. Walking to school, being bitten by a talking crow, spending time with friends, and watching the principal suplex a deer: they are all in a day's work in the extraordinary everyday lives of those in Nichijou. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":"Nichijou se centra principalmente en las travesuras diarias de un trío de amigas de la infancia (las chicas de secundaria Mio Naganohara, Yuuko Aioi y Mai Minakami) cuyas historias pronto se entrelazan con la joven genio Hakase Shinonome, su robot cuidador Nano y su gato parlante Sakamoto. Cada día que pasa, las vidas de estos seis, así como las de muchas personas que los rodean, experimentan tanto la calma de la vida normal como la locura de lo absurdo. Caminar a la escuela, ser mordido por un cuervo parlante, pasar tiempo con amigos y observar al director suplex contra un ciervo: todo ello forma parte de un día de trabajo en la extraordinaria vida cotidiana de los habitantes de Nichijou. \n\n[Escrito por MAL Rewrite]","type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1420,"average_episode_duration":1420,"startDate":"2011-04-03","start_date":"2011-04-03","endDate":"2011-09-25","end_date":"2011-09-25","season":"spring","year":2011,"start_season":{"year":2011,"season":"spring"},"episodes":26,"num_episodes":26,"score":8.4